    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that on Monday 2026-11-09 the flag goes on for the six design-partner customer accounts and for the CS team at the same time. The record lists statements about shipping, the flag, the what's-new note, and usage tracking, and it lists no unresolved items.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed by Ruth, Pavel, and Ines, with a passed recheck, that on Monday 2026-11-09 the flag goes on for the six design-partner customer accounts and for the CS team at the same time.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- A participant said to ship it to the pilot group on Monday.\n- A participant said Monday works.\n- A participant said they would flip the flag first thing.\n- A participant said they would write the what's-new note that shows up when they open reporting.\n- A participant said to keep it short with three bullets and a link.\n- A participant said sure.\n- A participant asked about usage tracking on each chart.\n- A participant said yes, chart opens and exports.\n- A participant said they would add the events before Monday.\n- A participant said they would want those numbers in two weeks."
